1 was healthy before restart, acknowledged the restart, became temporarily unreachable, returned with a different boot ID, and recovered its system, sshd, account, home, and administrative behavior. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently match the executor's pre- and post-restart observations.","limitations":[]}
